      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Overman Wheel Company’s factory, operating from 1882 to about 1899, once employed more than 1,200 workers in Chicopee’s booming bicycle industry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
