      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Westover Air Force Base, originally Westover Field, became an Air Force installation in 1948 and now hosts the 439th Airlift Wing flying C‑5 Galaxy aircraft.",
